text:
@yang3333/dsh-hermes-panel README · Panel：Health and update run the `official-web` distribution's own PowerShell scripts. An upstream pip
install has neither, so those two buttons are disabled there and the panel says why. Everything
else works on any install.

@yang3333/dsh-hermes-panel README · Bridge：With the bridge open, the panel writes the Hermes side (`mcp_servers.dsh`) into `config.yaml` and
checks that each profile's `@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` matches the running DSH. When one does not,
it prints the command that fixes it.

@yang3333/dsh-hermes-panel README · Security：The HTTP routes are loopback-only and check `Origin` and `Sec-Fetch-Site`. `.env` parsing keeps only
`HERMES_HOME`, `VENV`, `HERMES_EXE` and `DASHBOARD_PORT`; no other value is stored. Do not bind DSH
to `0.0.0.0` while the plugin is enabled.
